    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: March 4, 2026</p>
    <p>
        At NuviDoc, Inc. (&ldquo;NuviDoc,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; or
        &ldquo;us&rdquo;), we are committed to protecting your privacy. We take
        great care with your personal information that we gather when you access
        or use NuviDoc.com and related websites, applications, and services owned
        and operated by NuviDoc and that link to this Privacy Policy
        (collectively, the &ldquo;Services&rdquo;).&nbsp;
    </p>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy is meant to help consumers who use our Services
        (&ldquo;you,&rdquo; or &ldquo;your&rdquo;) understand how we treat your
        Personal Data. For the purposes of this Privacy Policy:&nbsp;
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <b
                ><i
                    >&ldquo;User&rdquo; means an individual who creates a NuviDoc
                    account to use the Services;&nbsp;</i
                ></b
            >
        </li>
        <li>
            <b
                ><i
                    >&ldquo;Visitor&rdquo; means an individual who engages with
                    our Services but does not have a NuviDoc account (for
                    example, if you visit our websites or download our mobile
                    application without creating a NuviDoc account). Please note
                    that some of our Services, including the ability to book an
                    appointment through our Services are limited to Users with a
                    NuviDoc account.&nbsp;</i
                ></b
            >
        </li>
        <li>
            <b
                ><i
                    >&ldquo;Personal Data&rdquo; means any information that
                    identifies or relates to a particular individual, and
                    includes information referred to as &ldquo;personally
                    identifiable information&rdquo; or &ldquo;personal
                    information&rdquo; under applicable data privacy laws,
                    rules, or regulations.&nbsp;</i
                ></b
            >
        </li>
        <li>
            For doctors, dentists, or other healthcare providers that use our
            marketing services, please click
            <a href="#healthcare-provider"
                ><b>here</b></a
            >
            to review the categories of information we collect.&nbsp;
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p></p>
    <p>
        <span style="font-weight: 700">
            BY USING OR ACCESSING THE SERVICES IN ANY MANNER, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE
            THAT YOU HAVE READ AND UNDERSTAND THIS PRIVACY POLICY AND AGREE TO
            THE PRACTICES AND POLICIES OUTLINED IN THIS PRIVACY POLICY. YOU
