            REPRESENT THAT YOU ARE AUTHORIZED BY SUCH INDIVIDUAL TO ACCEPT THIS
            PRIVACY POLICY ON THE INDIVIDUAL&rsquo;S BEHALF.&nbsp;
        </span>
    </p>

